msgstr "=== \"Ascend 950DT系列产品\""

msgid ""
"The host needs a working Ascend driver and firmware, plus Docker and [Ascend"
" Docker Runtime](#installation-ascend-docker-runtime). The image includes "
"the CANN user-space environment, PyTorch/TorchNPU, vLLM, and vLLM Ascend."
msgstr ""
"主机需要可正常工作的昇腾驱动和固件，以及 Docker 和 [昇腾 Docker Runtime](#installation-ascend-"
"docker-runtime)。镜像中包含 CANN 用户态环境、PyTorch/TorchNPU、vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend。"

